viors.\r\n- Improved Routing\r\n- PSR-0 and composer support.\r\n- Simpler configuration and bootstrapping.\r\n- Improved configuration handling.\r\n- Improved bake.\r\n\r\nSee [the roadmap](http://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/wiki/3.0-roadmap) for more details.","creator":null,"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":2464,"state":"closed","created_at":"2013-10-11T20:56:23Z","updated_at":"2015-12-17T03:00:48Z","due_on":"2015-03-22T04:00:00Z","closed_at":"2015-03-23T01:02:41Z"},"comments":8,"created_at":"2014-01-28T21:21:33Z","updated_at":"2014-01-29T15:51:20Z","closed_at":"2014-01-28T22:49:10Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I just tested CakePHP3.0 and I encountered a problem with the ORM that seems to crash when doing an all() followed by a count(); \n\n```\n    $query = TableRegistry::get('Posts')->find('all', [\n        'fields'   => ['Posts.id', 'Posts.name'],\n        'contain'=> ['Users'],\n        'limit'     => 10\n    ]);\n    debug($query->all()); // object(Cake\\ORM\\ResultSet)\n    debug($query->count()); // SQLSTATE[42000]: Syntax error or access violation: 1066 Not unique table/alias: 'Users'\n```\n\nCalling the two methods in the reverse order works\n\n```\n    $query = TableRegistry::get('Posts')->find('all', [\n        'fields'   => ['Posts.id', 'Posts.name'],\n        'contain'=> ['Users'],\n        'limit'     => 10\n    ]);\n    debug($query->count()); // (int)\n    debug($query->all()); // object(Cake\\ORM\\ResultSet)\n```\n\nThis problem also affect the paginatorComponent (since it calls the same methods in the same order) \n## The problem\n\nCalling all() seems to affect the query and the next calls.\n## The solution\n\nCall count() before find() in the PaginatorComponent\nAND/OR\nFix the all() method\n\nI'm not good enough to edit this myself I hope it helps\n","closed_by":{"login":"lorenzo","id":37621,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NjIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37621?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo","html_url":"https://github.com/lorenzo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorenzo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/2722/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/2722/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}